{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue Runner</strong> is a fast-paced Runner-like / Rogue-like, third-person shooter - action and parkour. You must run to break through the possibility you're stuck in. As you run you will <strong>discover different possibilities</strong>. Run, Kill, Die, Improve and Repeat to break the cycle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/c61c2a2a5772b71073c60917f5e6ded3.poster.avif?t=1756757638\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/c61c2a2a5772b71073c60917f5e6ded3.webm?t=1756757638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/c61c2a2a5772b71073c60917f5e6ded3.mp4?t=1756757638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A THIEF'S STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is the one thing a thief would never want to steal? Something that would bring them nothing but trouble. Yet, that\u2019s exactly what Alara did\u2014she stole a probability machine of unimaginable power. The moment she used it, she found herself trapped in an endless loop of impossibility. To break the cycle, she\u2019ll need all the help she can get\u2014because this will be a long run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/195970ac0f34593788b183ca56445868.poster.avif?t=1756757638\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/195970ac0f34593788b183ca56445868.webm?t=1756757638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/195970ac0f34593788b183ca56445868.mp4?t=1756757638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHOW YOUR RUN ON MAPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With fully procedural generation and different themed maps, you're the only one immune to the odds! No matter which map it is, enemy - trap - boss, you'll have to take them all down to break the cycle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACCEPT THE CHALLENGES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your run, listen out for merchants offering you different challenges or instant gifts. They're sure to have a whisper or two you'll enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/4a7bf01d35badeec7f26ebbfc7053a8d.poster.avif?t=1756757638\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/4a7bf01d35badeec7f26ebbfc7053a8d.webm?t=1756757638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/4a7bf01d35badeec7f26ebbfc7053a8d.mp4?t=1756757638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEVELOP YOUR CHARACTER IN THE VILLAGES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter which village you were born in, you can improve your character, try different builds and prepare yourself for much longer runs.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3332790?t=1756757638","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3332790?t=1756757638","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/6bdb40785aa2c07565d0976486a624f770ed511e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756757638","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/6bdb40785aa2c07565d0976486a624f770ed511e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756757638","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":51},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>ADD TO WISHLIST!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/6f67e3e720a36d94672fb2bd2c6d701f.poster.avif?t=1756757638\" width=800 height=66 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/6f67e3e720a36d94672fb2bd2c6d701f.webm?t=1756757638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/6f67e3e720a36d94672fb2bd2c6d701f.mp4?t=1756757638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue Runner</strong> is a fast-paced Runner-like / Rogue-like, third-person shooter - action and parkour. You must run to break through the possibility you're stuck in. As you run you will <strong>discover different possibilities</strong>. Run, Kill, Die, Improve and Repeat to break the cycle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/c61c2a2a5772b71073c60917f5e6ded3.poster.avif?t=1756757638\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/c61c2a2a5772b71073c60917f5e6ded3.webm?t=1756757638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/c61c2a2a5772b71073c60917f5e6ded3.mp4?t=1756757638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A THIEF'S STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is the one thing a thief would never want to steal? Something that would bring them nothing but trouble. Yet, that\u2019s exactly what Alara did\u2014she stole a probability machine of unimaginable power. The moment she used it, she found herself trapped in an endless loop of impossibility. To break the cycle, she\u2019ll need all the help she can get\u2014because this will be a long run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/195970ac0f34593788b183ca56445868.poster.avif?t=1756757638\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/195970ac0f34593788b183ca56445868.webm?t=1756757638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/195970ac0f34593788b183ca56445868.mp4?t=1756757638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHOW YOUR RUN ON MAPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With fully procedural generation and different themed maps, you're the only one immune to the odds! No matter which map it is, enemy - trap - boss, you'll have to take them all down to break the cycle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACCEPT THE CHALLENGES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your run, listen out for merchants offering you different challenges or instant gifts. They're sure to have a whisper or two you'll enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/4a7bf01d35badeec7f26ebbfc7053a8d.poster.avif?t=1756757638\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/4a7bf01d35badeec7f26ebbfc7053a8d.webm?t=1756757638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/4a7bf01d35badeec7f26ebbfc7053a8d.mp4?t=1756757638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEVELOP YOUR CHARACTER IN THE VILLAGES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter which village you were born in, you can improve your character, try different builds and prepare yourself for much longer runs.</p>","developers":["42nd Machine"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/31f2f407dce42a7c0e0fb516500a3698e0057f53/header.jpg?t=1756757638","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Rogue Runner","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"},"plat